BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CASABLANCA PRESS: THE FLYING MONKEYS PROJECT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T232859
UID:4a6e394e6a61c8db4acef75a5852f2ed@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:The term "flying monkeys" — borrowed from the Wicked Witch's
  enforcers in The Wizard of Oz — refers to people who a narcissist recru
 its\, whether consciously or unconsciously\, to extend their reach\, contr
 ol\, and influence beyond what they can achieve alone. Flying monkeys carr
 y messages\, gather information\, deliver guilt or pressure\, spread false
  narratives\, and otherwise serve the narcissist's agenda\, often while be
 lieving they are simply helping or mediating a conflict. “Flying Monkeys
  in Narcissistic Abuse: What They Are and How to Protect Yourself” ( Sim
 ply Psychology ) This project is based on a book that I have started writi
 ng\, titled The ABCs of Trump’s Flying Monkeys. The book is going to be 
 a collection of poems about Trump’s “enablers\,” placed in alphabeti
 cal order. Each letter of the alphabet has at least one name (ex. Q’Anon
 ) and some letters have more than one name (ex. B has 6 names). There are 
 60 names in all (and therefore 60 poems). I have written three poems alrea
 dy. I tried to use one of the almost 300 forms of poetry for each poem to 
 give the book variety. “Pam Bondi” is an acrostic sonnet. “Vladimir 
 Putin” is a haibun. And “I.C.E.” will be a set of acrostic haikus. &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;I’m not looking for satire or humor as much as I am lookin
 g for how each qualifies as a flying monkey according to the definition ci
 ted above\, and what that person has done to earn that “honor.” Each o
 f the poets who participate in this project will be recognized for the poe
 m he/she wrote on the page with the poem\, and a brief 3-4 sentence biogra
 phy included in the back of the book. &nbsp\;Below is a list of the 60 fly
 ing monkeys I have identified and the role that entitles them to the title
 : (Once a name is taken by a poet\, that poet’s name will appear next to
  the name of the flying monkey\, in red.) A&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Samuel Al
 ito – US Supreme Court Justice - Pam Laskin B&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Steve
  Bannon – Republican Political Operative - Alex S. Johnson Scott Bessent
  – Secretary of the Treasury - Mike Jurkovic Todd Blanche – US Attorne
 y General - Rick Spisak Pam Bondi – Former US Attorney General - Christo
 pher Bogart Gregory Bovino – Former Commander-at-Large\, US Border Patro
 l Doug Burgum – Secretary of the Interior C &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Aileen Cannon 
 – US District Court Judge - Rich Luc Brendan Carr – Chairman of the F.
 C.C. - Rick Spisak Roy Cohn – The Sorcerer - Raymond Nat Turner Edward C
 oristine (“Big Balls”) – Head of Engineering\, W.H.N.D.S - Christoph
 er Bogart D &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Department of War - Dario Cvencek D.O.G.E. – D
 epartment of Government Efficiency - Raymond Nat Turner &nbsp\; Byron Dona
 lds – US Representative (R/FL) - Pam Laskin Sean Duffy – US Secretary 
 of Transportation - Pam Laskin E &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Larry and David Ellison –
  Billionaires\, Co-Founders of Oracle\, owners of Skydance-Paramount Globa
 l. - Richard Loranger F &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Michael Flynn – Retired US Army Li
 eutenant General.&nbsp\; G &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Tulsi Gabbard – Director of Nat
 ional Intelligence Kimberly Guilfoyle – former US Ambassador to Greece -
  Linda Muhlhausen H &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Alina Habba – Counselor to the Preside
 nt Natalie Harp – “Special” Presidential Assistant - Ellyn Maybe Pet
 e Hegseth – US Secretary of Defense - Alex S. Johnson Tom Holman – Bor
 der Czar I&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; I.C.E. (US Immigration and Customs Enforce
 ment) - Dario Cvencek Davis Ingle – White House Spokesman 1\,500 Pardone
 d Insurrectionists\, January 6\, 2021 - Christopher Bogart J&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
 &nbsp\; Mike Johnson – Speaker of the House of Representatives. - Mike J
 urkovic K&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Robert F. Kennedy\, Jr. – US Secretary of
  Health and Human Services. - Susanna Rich Jared Kushner – Special Peace
  Envoy - Dario Cvencek L &nbsp\;&nbsp\; Karoline Levitt – former White H
 ouse Press Secretary - Susanna Rich Howard Luttnick – US Secretary of Co
 mmerce - Canadian Poet M&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Ghislaine Maxwell – Jeffre
 y Epstein co-conspirator - Raymond Nat Turner Linda McCann – US Secretar
 y of Education Mitch McConnell – US Senator\, Tennessee - Patricia Carra
 gon Stephen Miller – Deputy Chief-of-Staff - Jan Steckel Markwayne Mulle
 n – US Secretary of Homeland Security - Sue Storts Elon Musk – SGE of 
 DOGE - John Trause N&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Kristi Noem – Former Secretary
  of Homeland Security. - Pam Laskin O&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Mehmet Oz – A
 dministrator for the Centers of Medicare &amp\; Medicaid Services - Ameera
 h Shabazz P&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Kash Patel – Director of the F.B.I. Jea
 nine Pirro – US Attorney\, District of Columbia Владимир Пут
 ин/Vladimir Putin – President of The Russian Federation - Christopher 
 Bogart Q&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Q’Anon – “a baseless\, far-right polit
 ical conspiracy theory and political movement.” (Wikipedia) - Laura Dani
 els R&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; John Ratcliffe – Director of the C.I.A. Brook
 e Rollins – US Secretary of Agriculture Marco Rubio – US Secretary of 
 State - Crystal Davis S&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Tim Scott – US Senator (R/S
 C) Elise Stefanik – US Ambassador to the U.N. Roger Stone – Republican
  Political Operative T&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Peter Theil – Billionaire\, 
 Founder of Palantir Technologies - Mike Jurkovic Clarence Thomas – US Su
 preme Court Justice - Margaret Sáraco D. J. T. Jr. – Eldest Son &nbsp\;
  U&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Richard and Elizabeth Uihlein – Billionaires\, M
 ajor Contributors to the Republican Party V&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; J.D. Vanc
 e – Vice-President of the United States Russell Vought – Director\, OM
 B - Rick Spisak W&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Susan Wiles – White House Chief-of-Staff
  - Angie Williams Brown Steve Witkoff – Special Diplomatic Envoy X&nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Space X/Starlink – American Aerospace Technologies - Joh
 n Trause Y&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Ye/Kanye West – Rapper\, songwriter and 
 record producer - Alex S. Johnson Z&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Lee Zeldin – Ad
 ministrator\, Environmental Protection Agency - Jennifer M. Phillips Mark 
 Zuckerberg – Founder\, C.E.O. of Meta and Facebook - Crystal Davis I enc
 ourage you to share this project description with fellow poets who you fee
 l would be interested in participating. If you are interested in participa
 ting\, please email me with the “monkey(s)” of your choice so that I c
 an update the list. Remember\, while I don’t mind the list of monkeys ex
 panding\, and each poet taking up to three names\, I only want to include 
 one poem per monkey. I don’t want to give any one of them more attention
  than any of the others. Hopefully\, that will be given to them in the fut
 ure by a jury of their peers. THEME: POETRY ANTHOLOGY HOST: Christopher Bo
 gart (Editor) FEATURES: FULL LIST TO BE ANNOUNCED PRICE: FREE CONTACT: Em
 ail cabogart@aol.com to submit poem(s)
LOCATION:NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/casablanca-press-the-flying-mo
 nkeys-project
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
