 d\, Princeton Junction\, NJ 08550 Theme: Original Poetry Host: West Windso
 r Arts Price: Free Phone: (609) 716-9131 Email Address: Kimberly@westwinds
 orarts.org Website: https://www.westwindsorarts.org/event/open-mouth-poetr
 y-2 Social Media: @westwindsorarts Event Description: Open Mouth Poetry ha
 s become a beloved annual event\, offered each November in support of Arts
  and Health month. It is an opportunity to promote poetry’s role in heal
 ing\, affirming\, and nurturing healthy individuals. Local poets are invit
 ed to read their original poetry in front of a supportive audience. Open t
 o all poets aged 15 and older. Poetry themes may be diverse\, but the salv
 e of the art form will carry throughout. Those interested in reading will 
 sign up to read upon entry to the event. The first 28 sign-ups get a guara
 nteed opportunity to read. Each reader gets a limited amount of time to re
 ad (3 minutes). Listeners are also very welcome to attend! Cost to partici
 pate is free. Please register in advance to assist with planning. Coffee\,
  tea\, and sweets will be served.
