DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T160000
UID:c54ce5d1ad63f44e60c673578500dabd@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:POETS! The world needs your writing in print! Next month join 
 two @jcwriters for a FREE multi-series workshop on bringing your poetry ma
 nuscript to life. Susan Justinian @rescuepoetix and Tabitha Dial @tabithad
 ial will guide you through the publication process. Make your piles of poe
 ms work for you. This class will help you put together your best work for 
 publication. Nurture your poetic lifeblood and connect to fellow poets as 
 you learn how to create a poetry manuscript. Find new strengths\, overcome
  challenges\, and make the most of the obsessions in your existing writing
 . Register on Meetup\, and we can’t wait to see your work! THEME: FIND Y
 OUR FLOW HOST: JERSEY CITY WRITERS FEATURES: RESCUEPOETIX &amp\; TABITHA D
 IAL PRICE: FREE - https://www.meetup.com/the-jersey-city-writers-meetup-gr
 oup/events/314915536 CONTACT: @jcwriters
LOCATION:ARTS 14C (RM 608)\, 157B 1ST STREET\, JERSEY CITY\, NJ 07302
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/publishing-poetry-with-rescuep
 oetix-tabitha-dial-11-14
