BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mile Square Theatre: For Colored Girls Who Have Considered Suicide
 /When the Rainbow Is Enuf (Copy)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T210000
UID:23f36277d7fe2da5d371506c6c1e51e0@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Mile Square Theatre: For Colored Girls Who Have Considered&nbs
 p\; Suicide/When the Rainbow Is Enuf ­Performances: November 6th - Novemb
 er 15th Mile Square Theatre\, in collaboration with Daryl Stewart Producti
 ons\, presents for colored girls who have considered suicide / when the ra
 inbow is enuf\, written by Ntozake Shange and directed by Daryl Stewart. S
 hange's landmark choreopoem stands among the most transformative works in 
 the American theatrical canon. Fifty years after its 1976 Broadway premier
 e\, this form-defying fusion of poetry\, song\, and movement has given voi
 ce to the interior lives of women of color with a force and beauty unmatch
 ed in our national theater. Cast &amp\; Creative Team: Zaria Monae as Lady
  in Brown Lynn Irby Hill as Lady in Red Positive as Lady in Blue Camille U
 pshaw as Lady in Green Brissae Valdes as Lady in Yellow Madison Star Brim 
 as Lady in Orange CiMa as Lady in Purple Justin Dominic\, Co-Director/Chor
 eographer Nikkia Tyrie Neal\, Movement Director Trezana Beverley - Acting 
 Coach/Consultant Marco Hall - Costume Design Dates: November 13–15\, 202
 6 November 13\, 7:00 PM November 14\, 7:00 PM November 15\, 2:00 PM Specia
 l Nights: 11/13: Divine Nine Night: Wear your letters\, rep your org Ticke
 ts: $40 | $30 Students | MST Members Get 50% Off Location: Mile Square The
 atre 1400 Clinton Street Hoboken\, NJ 07030 THEME: A choreopoem of poetry\
 , music\, and movement celebrating the resilience and joy of Black women. 
 HOST: Daryl Stewart FEATURES: Zaria Monae as Lady in Brown / Lynn Irby Hil
 l as Lady in Red / Positive as Lady in Blue Camille Upshaw as Lady in Gree
 n / Brissae Valdes as Lady in Yellow Madison Star Brim as Lady in Orange /
  CiMa as Lady in Purple / Justin Dominic\, Co-Director/Choreographer / Nik
 kia Tyrie Neal\, Movement Director / Trezana Beverley - Acting Coach/Consu
 ltant / Marco Hall - Costume Design PRICE: Tickets: $40 / $30 Students / M
 ST Members Get 50% Off CONTACT: 201-683-7014 / info@milesquaretheatre.org
LOCATION:Mile Square Theatre\, 1400 Clinton Street\, Hoboken\, NJ 07030
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/for-colored-girls-who-have-con
 sidered-suicide/when-the-rainbow-is-enuf-11-14
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
