DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: &nbsp\;Story &amp\; Verse: A Storytelling and P
 oetic Open Mic Date: &nbsp\;November 19\, 2026 Start/End Time: &nbsp\;7:00
  pm - 9:00 pm Address: &nbsp\;102 Witherspoon Street\, Princeton\, NJ 0854
