DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T220000
UID:2924a358adf3925def43f657b9842195@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: LetItFlow Poetry Show Date: November 20\, 2026 
 Start/End Time: 7:00 pm Address: 1050 Stuyvesant Ave Union NJ Theme: Commu
 nity\, Peace\, Giving Thanks Host: Elijah Brown Feature(s): Starski Price:
  Advanced Tix for performers $5 Attendees $10 before 11/19 Phone: (862) 30
 6-1758 Email Address: lifpublishing@gmail.com Social Media: @Elijahbr85 Ev
 ent Description: WHAT ARE YOU THANKFUL FOR? Join us Friday\, November 20th
  at the House of Playokee for another night of Poetry\, Karaoke\, good foo
 d\, great people\, and positive energy. This month we’re featuring STARS
 KI\, former host of Live and Direct. Starski brings the type of presence t
 hat comes from years of being connected to the culture\, the microphone\, 
 and the people. As an artist and host\, he understands how to command a ro
 om while still making the audience feel like they are part of the experien
 ce. We’re excited to give him the Let It Flow stage and let him do what 
 he does. Hosted by yours truly\, Elijah Brown Let It Flow: Chapter 21\, Ep
 isode 3 Friday\, November 20\, 2026 House of Playokee 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\
 , Union\, NJ Doors: 7 PM Showtime: 8 PM Audience: $10 advance | $15 door P
 erformers: $5 advance | $10 door Performance spots are limited. And since 
 it’s Scorpio Season\, if your birthday is around the corner\, come celeb
 rate with us! So I’ll ask again… What are YOU thankful for? Come put i
 t in a poem. Sing it in a song. Or just come enjoy the vibe. November 20th
 . We Flow Again. THEME: Community\, Peace\, Giving Thanks HOST: Elijah Bro
 wn FEATURES: Starski PRICE: Advanced Tix for performers $5 / Attendees $10
  before 11/19 / Performance spots are limited. CONTACT: (862) 306-1758 / @
 Elijahbr85 / lifpublishing@gmail.com
LOCATION:1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union NJ\, Union\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/letitflow-poetry-show
