BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MOCHA MIC with MILLIE
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T220000
UID:e68392e9947ecc50063c0b38ad9814f3@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, November 20\, we’re returning to The Neighbors S
 tudio in Jersey City for an evening of poetry\, spoken word\, faith-filled
  storytelling\, laughs\, and community. Come share your talent\, support l
 ocal artists\, reconnect with familiar faces\, or meet someone new. There
 ’s always room for more good vibes at the mic! We’re wrapping up 2026 
 with FOUR incredible featured artists! Ms. Jenn ( @queenjenn25 ) &nbsp\;- 
 A Jersey City poet whose work explores identity\, motherhood\, disability\
 , grief\, and healing. Noel A. Figueroa\, The Anointed Pen ( @theanointedp
 en ) &nbsp\;- A Brooklyn-based poet\, author\, and workshop facilitator wh
 ose work is rooted in faith and inspiration. Tiana Marie\, Ed.M. ( @tianam
 ariecreates ) &nbsp\;- A writer and spoken word artist whose work celebrat
 es Black womanhood\, love\, joy\, faith\, and healing. Kellz “Jokenword
 ” Barksdale ( @jokenword ) &nbsp\;- A New Jersey comedian and spoken wor
 d poet bringing his signature blend of punchlines and poetry to the mic. E
 VENT DETAILS Friday\, November 20\, 2026 7:00–10:00 PM The Neighbors Stu
 dio\, 370 Pacific Avenue\, Jersey City\, NJ 07304 $20 for attendees | $15 
 for performers Food and drinks will be available for purchase\, and open m
 ic spots are limited\, so come ready to share! Please find the event flyer
  attached for more details\, and feel free to share it with friends who wo
 uld enjoy an evening of creativity\, connection\, and community. Get Your 
 Tickets Here! Mocha Mic with Millie has always been about creating space f
 or Black artists\, emerging voices\, and people who believe in the power o
 f creativity and community. Thank you to everyone who has shown up\, share
 d the mic\, supported our featured artists\, and helped keep this space go
 ing. Your presence truly makes a difference. Let’s close out the year to
 gether with good people\, powerful words\, and plenty of laughs! I look fo
 rward to seeing the Tribe of Scribes &amp\; Good Vibes soon! With love and
  gratitude\, Millicent&nbsp\; Ansah Founder\, Curator &amp\; Host Mocha Mi
 c with Millie THEME: OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: Millicent Ansah FEATURES: M
 s. Jenn ( @queenjenn25 ) / Noel A. Figueroa\, The Anointed Pen ( @theanoin
 tedpen ) Tiana Marie\, Ed.M. ( @tianamariecreates ) / Kellz “Jokenword
 ” Barksdale ( @jokenword ) James C. Ellerbe (Vendor) PRICE: $20 for atte
 ndees / $15 for performers - https://www.eventbrite.com/e/mocha-mic-with-m
 illie-last-show-of-2026-tickets-2003559923666 CONTACT: @mochamicwithmillie
LOCATION:The Neighbors Studio\, 370 Pacific Avenue\, Jersey City\, NJ\, 07
 304
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/mocha-mic-with-millie
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
